MAYOR OF SEMARANG

MAYOR OF SEMARANG

CENTRAL JAVA PROVINCE

REGIONAL REGULATION OF SEMARANG CITY

NUMBER 7 OF 2023

CONCERNING

EMPOWERMENT AND PROTECTION OF WOMEN

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

MAYOR OF SEMARANG,

Considering : a. that women constitute a national asset who play a crucial role in the process of succession and creation of quality generations, and need to obtain guarantees for the fulfillment of their rights to be empowered so that they can actualize their potential optimally and obtain guarantees of protection from acts of violence against women;

b. that in order to provide a means for women's self-actualization and guarantees of protection in the community in the city of Semarang, there is a need for a regional regulation governing the empowerment and protection of women;

c. that pursuant to Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government as amended several times most recently by Law Number 6 of 2023 concerning the Stipulation of Government Regulation in Lieu of Law Number 2 of 2022 concerning Job Creation into Law, regional governments have authority in the administration of governmental affairs in the field of empowerment and protection of women;

d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letters a, b, and c, it is necessary to enact a Regional Regulation concerning Empowerment and Protection of Women;

In View of : 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia:

2. Law Number 16 of 1950 concerning the Establishment of Large City Regions Within the Provinces of East Java, Central Java, West Java, and the Special Region of Yogyakarta (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1950 Number 45);
3. Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2014 Number 244, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5587) as amended several times most recently by Law Number 6 of 2023 concerning the Stipulation of Government Regulation in Lieu of Law Number 2 of 2022 concerning Job Creation into Law (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2023 Number 41, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6856);
4. Law Number 11 of 2023 concerning Central Java Province (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2023 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6867);

With Mutual Approval, THE REGIONAL HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES OF SEMARANG CITY and

MAYOR OF SEMARANG

DECIDES:

To Enact : REGIONAL REGULATION CONCERNING EMPOWERMENT AND PROTECTION OF WOMEN.

